    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "計算機概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO  COMPUTER AND COMPUTING",
    "describe_ch": "1.電腦原理：軟、硬體簡介。 2.電腦運作原理。 3. 電腦程式運作原理。4. Fortran程式語法的寫作。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "This is an introductory course on computer technology. It covers the introduction of hardware, software, concepts of computer operation, and Fortran language program skills and coding.",
